## Interface: 30300
## Title: TormentD3
## Notes: A Diablo III skin for the Diablocraft UI. Never shipped: install it by hand.
## Author: Diablocraft
## Version: 0.1
## Dependencies: Torment
## OptionalDeps: ElvUI_Torment

# One file: the skin has no logic, it only fills the Diablocraft.ART slots that
# ElvUI_Torment reads (Torment/SKINNING.md). Torment must be loaded first, which
# the dependency above guarantees; ElvUI_Torment reads the slots at its own
# Initialize, after every addon has loaded, so this never races it.
TormentD3.lua
